\[
\Delta E = hc/\lambda \approx \frac{6.626\times10^{-34} \cdot 3\times10^8}{4.861\times10^{-7}} \approx 4.09\times10^{-19}\,\text{J}.
\]

Comparing:  
\(10^{-23} \ll 4\times10^{-19}\), so  
\[
\left\langle H \right\rangle \ll \Delta E.
\]

